<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">The connection recovers just as someone arrives to help. Instead of trying to recreate every interruption, keep a short diary of what happened during normal use. A useful diary records the symptom and the gaps in your knowledge, without guessing at the cause.</p>
<h2 class="mt-12 mb-5 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-ink md:text-3xl">Capture the next incident</h2>
<p class="mb-5 leading-relaxed text-muted">Use paper or a note stored on your own device. Record the incident when convenient; do not interrupt something important simply to collect a measurement.</p>
